          "stage2_correction": {
            "pair": "የረ -> ፆረ",
            "reason": "In Luke 11:46 ('እስመ ታፀውርዎ ለሰብእ ፆረ ክቡደ'), the printed glyph is 'ፆረ' (accusative of ፆር, 'burden', matching 'ሸክም' in L08 and 'ፆር' in L12), where 'ፆ' was misread as 'የ'."
